    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>LUSTRA: Lachea\u2019s Tale is a story-rich RPG that combines real-time spellcasting, exploration, and settlement building, set in a fractured floating island realm where ancient magic and mystery intertwine.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lachea, a young mage shaped by the world around her, learning to lead, grow, and take control of her path in a land suspended between ruin and renewal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lustra invites players to see the world through multiple perspectives, to reflect on morality, empathy, and responsibility, and to shape not just the outcome of a magical world, but the kind of person Lachea becomes along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/252d2afb45235f9ea384339815635ae1.poster.avif?t=1754041031\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/252d2afb45235f9ea384339815635ae1.webm?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/252d2afb45235f9ea384339815635ae1.mp4?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her sister disappears without a trace, Lachea sets out across a fragmented world shaped by magic and memory.\u00a0<br><br>As the journey unfolds, she\u2019s faced with situations that offer no easy answers - from <strong>conversations that challenge her beliefs</strong>, to <strong>conflicts that test her priorities</strong>, to <strong>decisions that shape not only her future but that of the people who rely on her</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/7b17537b5ca40d4d1d24f510b472bce8.poster.avif?t=1754041031\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/7b17537b5ca40d4d1d24f510b472bce8.webm?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/7b17537b5ca40d4d1d24f510b472bce8.mp4?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build a self-sustaining village in the skies by assigning tasks based on <strong>each character\u2019s unique talents</strong>, managing <strong>limited resources</strong>, and planning <strong>building layouts</strong> that support both function and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a close eye on <strong>community morale</strong>, where the emotional well-being of the people is just as important as their productivity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/be0bd775e78978b77bf19f6c477f90d8.poster.avif?t=1754041031\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/be0bd775e78978b77bf19f6c477f90d8.webm?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/be0bd775e78978b77bf19f6c477f90d8.mp4?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face magical threats through <strong>real-time, spell-driven combat</strong> that rewards timing, precision, and awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful <strong>spells</strong> and upgrade Lachea\u2019s <strong>talents</strong> to shape a combat style that grows with her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/0d3c5df9515f99d1de0f66f581108fc4.poster.avif?t=1754041031\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/0d3c5df9515f99d1de0f66f581108fc4.webm?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/0d3c5df9515f99d1de0f66f581108fc4.mp4?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>puzzles</strong> and <strong>mini-games</strong> hidden throughout the world, waiting to be uncovered through exploration. Some are simple. Some ask more. All offer a quiet break from the road ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alright, enough reading. Go play the demo already. You\u2019ll get to know the game way better by playing than by reading our rambling!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>LUSTRA: Lachea\u2019s Tale is a story-rich RPG that combines real-time spellcasting, exploration, and settlement building, set in a fractured floating island realm where ancient magic and mystery intertwine.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Lachea, a young mage shaped by the world around her, learning to lead, grow, and take control of her path in a land suspended between ruin and renewal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lustra invites players to see the world through multiple perspectives, to reflect on morality, empathy, and responsibility, and to shape not just the outcome of a magical world, but the kind of person Lachea becomes along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/252d2afb45235f9ea384339815635ae1.poster.avif?t=1754041031\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/252d2afb45235f9ea384339815635ae1.webm?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/252d2afb45235f9ea384339815635ae1.mp4?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her sister disappears without a trace, Lachea sets out across a fragmented world shaped by magic and memory.\u00a0<br><br>As the journey unfolds, she\u2019s faced with situations that offer no easy answers - from <strong>conversations that challenge her beliefs</strong>, to <strong>conflicts that test her priorities</strong>, to <strong>decisions that shape not only her future but that of the people who rely on her</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/7b17537b5ca40d4d1d24f510b472bce8.poster.avif?t=1754041031\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/7b17537b5ca40d4d1d24f510b472bce8.webm?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/7b17537b5ca40d4d1d24f510b472bce8.mp4?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build a self-sustaining village in the skies by assigning tasks based on <strong>each character\u2019s unique talents</strong>, managing <strong>limited resources</strong>, and planning <strong>building layouts</strong> that support both function and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a close eye on <strong>community morale</strong>, where the emotional well-being of the people is just as important as their productivity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/be0bd775e78978b77bf19f6c477f90d8.poster.avif?t=1754041031\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/be0bd775e78978b77bf19f6c477f90d8.webm?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/be0bd775e78978b77bf19f6c477f90d8.mp4?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face magical threats through <strong>real-time, spell-driven combat</strong> that rewards timing, precision, and awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful <strong>spells</strong> and upgrade Lachea\u2019s <strong>talents</strong> to shape a combat style that grows with her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/0d3c5df9515f99d1de0f66f581108fc4.poster.avif?t=1754041031\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/0d3c5df9515f99d1de0f66f581108fc4.webm?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301430/extras/0d3c5df9515f99d1de0f66f581108fc4.mp4?t=1754041031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>puzzles</strong> and <strong>mini-games</strong> hidden throughout the world, waiting to be uncovered through exploration. Some are simple. Some ask more. All offer a quiet break from the road ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alright, enough reading. Go play the demo already. You\u2019ll get to know the game way better by playing than by reading our rambling!</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "Guide Lachea, a young mage rebuilding life among the clouds. Grow a village, master spellcasting, and make choices that shape not just a world, but a person in a story about connection, self-discovery, and the quiet power of doing the right thing.",
